@MyRealAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5062

### Listar el catálogo
GET {{MyRealAPI_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Consultar un producto
GET {{MyRealAPI_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### Producto inexistente: debe responder 404
GET {{MyRealAPI_HostAddress}}/api/products/999
Accept: application/json
